<div class="container-narrow pt-4 pb-10">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 text-muted">Last updated <%= lastUpdated %>.</p>

  <div class="prose mt-6">
    <p>
      <%= siteName %> helps people on campus return lost belongings. This page explains what we collect,
      why we collect it, who can see it and how long we keep it. We only collect what the service needs to work.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account details:</strong> your name, email address, whether you are a student or staff member, and your campus ID number if you choose to add it. Your password is stored only as a one-way bcrypt hash.</li>
      <li><strong>Listings:</strong> the title, description, category, color, location, date and photos you add when you report an item.</li>
      <li><strong>Claims:</strong> the proof-of-ownership details you write when you claim an item.</li>
      <li><strong>Messages:</strong> the text of chats you take part in, when each message was sent and whether it has been read.</li>
      <li><strong>Session cookie:</strong> one cookie named <code>lf.sid</code> that keeps you logged in. It expires after 7 days without use.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What other people can see</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Anyone, including visitors who are not logged in, can see listings and their photos together with the reporter's first name.</li>
      <li>Your full name, email address and campus ID are never shown to other users.</li>
      <li>A claim is visible only to you and to the person who reported the item.</li>
      <li>A conversation is visible only to its two participants.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Photos can contain more than you intend. Avoid uploading images that show faces, ID numbers or card numbers in full.</p>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To show listings and let people search them.</li>
      <li>To let owners claim items and let finders review those claims.</li>
      <li>To deliver chat messages and show unread counts and read receipts.</li>
      <li>To protect the service, for example by limiting repeated login attempts.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell data, show advertising or use analytics or tracking cookies.</p>

    <h2>Third parties</h2>
    <p>
      Page styles are loaded from the jsDelivr content delivery network, which receives your IP address and browser
      details when it serves the stylesheet. No other third-party services receive your data.
    </p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Listings, claims and messages are kept until they are deleted.</li>
      <li>When you delete a listing, its photos, its claims and every conversation about it are deleted with it.</li>
      <li>Login sessions are removed automatically 7 days after they were last used.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      You can edit or delete any listing you created from your <a href="/dashboard">dashboard</a>. To get a copy of your data
      or to have your account deleted,
      <% if (contactEmail) { %>
        email <a href="mailto:<%= contactEmail %>"><%= contactEmail %></a>.
      <% } else { %>
        contact the campus office that runs this service.
      <% } %>
      We respond within 30 days.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>If we change how data is handled, we will update this page and the date at the top.</p>

    <p class="mt-8"><a href="/items">Browse lost and found items</a> or <a href="/">go back to the home page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>
